  "id": "behavioral-approach-system",
  "term": "behavioral approach system",
  "definition": "The behavioral approach system is a personality-related motivational system describing how strongly a person is oriented toward appetitive cues such as reward. It reflects the degree to which someone tends to respond and function when exposed to rewarding stimuli and is discussed as part of self-regulation.",
